/**
 * Our services hub  ·  /studio
 *
 * Built around the two complementary pillars of hubStudio services on top of
 * the hubStudio app (hubstudio-positioning.md):
 *  - Pillar · Creative assets: twenty service lines across six studio groups
 *    (/services/design/*), led by senior art directors with brand-trained
 *    models, studio GPU pipelines, and hybrid live shoots.
 *  - Pillar · Social networks: twelve service lines across three social tracks
 *    (/services/social/*), running organic content, company pages, paid social
 *    funnels, and executive advocacy across Western and Chinese networks.
 *
 * Includes interactive UI components and scroll/pointer JS engines:
 *  - Scroll progress bar & scroll-reactive ambient orbs/timelines
 *  - Kinetic hero entrance, magnetic buttons, count-up SLA metrics
 *  - Interactive Two-Pillar Architecture explorer with 3D pointer tilt & glow
 *  - Creative Assets interactive category switcher with sliding ink bar
 *  - Social Networks dark Command Studio with interactive track tabs, 12
 *    service cards, and a live AppShot screen stage
 *  - Interactive Western & China platform ecosystem filter matrix
 *  - Interactive Workspace Setup switcher (In our workspace vs In yours)
 *  - Interactive 5-stage project pipeline & filterable FAQ
 *
 * No ordinal numerals in any card, step, or repeated block. No em-dash.
 */
